            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-119378-libsqlite3-0",
              "name": "DpkgMatcherExactIndirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-119378 medium vulnerability for libsqlite3-0 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SQLite before 3.54.0 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the R-Tree extension that allows attackers to make applications use freed heap memory by manipulating the %_node shadow table. Attackers can supply a database declaring %_node WITHOUT ROWID or with a RAISE(IGNORE) trigger so nodeWrite() hashes nodes as 0, crashing the process after node splits."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-119378",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-119378\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: libsqlite3-0\nVersion: 3.46.1-7+deb13u2\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: debian:distro:debian:13\nLink: [CVE-2026-119378](https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-119378)",
